# Cloudflare Pages — _redirects
# Apex normalisation
https://www.wayward.house/*  https://wayward.house/:splat  301!

# ── Old URL continuity (301 permanent) ────────────────────────────────────────
# These can go live immediately — destination doesn't need to exist yet.
# Old signal slugs → new issue-NNN path
/articles/system-signals-001*  /signals/issue-001/  301
/articles/system-signals-002*  /signals/issue-002/  301
/articles/system-signals-003*  /signals/issue-003/  301
/articles/system-signals-004*  /signals/issue-004/  301
# All other /articles/* → /essays/*
/articles/:slug  /essays/:slug/  301

# ── Essays + Signals proxy (200 = transparent proxy) ─────────────────────────
# Uncomment each line once the CF Pages project is live and verified.
# /essays/*   https://wh-essays.pages.dev/:splat   200
# /signals/*  https://wh-signals.pages.dev/:splat  200

